sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BCO as BCO
    participant BTO as BTO
    participant Store as BTO State store
    participant Exec as Execution (composition-internal)

    BCO->>BTO: Submit build-test plan request (composition name)
    BTO->>Store: Deduplicate plan request
    BTO-->>BCO: Plan identity

    Note over BTO,Exec: Composition resolution and role call pattern are BTO-internal
    BTO->>Exec: Execute build/test for the composition
    Exec-->>BTO: Completed execution output

    BTO->>Store: Preserve final build-test plan result
    BTO-->>BCO: Terminal-state notification
    BCO->>BTO: Read final build-test plan result
    BTO-->>BCO: Final build-test plan result
